    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>1级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>小型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 29；''重伤'' 14</span><span>''先攻'' +5</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 15，''强韧'' 13，''反射'' 15，''意志'' 13</span><span>''侦查'' +1</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">完美走位</div>\n<div class=description>若该地精处于骑乘状态且其坐骑结束回合时距其开始时的位置至少 4 格，则该骑乘状态下<br>的地精的攻击造成 1d6 额外伤害直到该坐骑下回合开始。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}标枪（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+6vs.AC<br>命中：1d6+6 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}标枪（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 10（一个生物）+6vs.AC<br>命中：1d6+5 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">骑乘地精战术✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>前提：该地精必须处于骑乘状态。<br>触发：一次近战攻击对该地精或其坐骑失手。效果（直觉反应）：该地精的坐骑快步一格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 隐秘+8，盗术+8</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 13（+1）</span><span>''敏捷'' 17（+3）</span><span>''感知'' 12（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 13（+1）</span><span>''智力'' 8（-1）</span><span>''魅力'' 8（-1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，地精语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 皮甲，6 把标枪</span></div></div>\n</div>",
